1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,459
Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.

2
00:00:02,759 --> 00:00:08,019
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets the Little Prince~

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:18,300
Last time, Qiqi met the geographer who never goes outside.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:26,740
Books hold knowledge, but you have to go out to smell the wind!

5
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:35,100
Today, the little prince finally reaches Earth — what will he see?

6
00:00:35,399 --> 00:00:38,019
The little prince landed on Earth.

7
00:00:38,319 --> 00:00:40,539
He came to a big garden.

8
00:00:40,839 --> 00:00:44,499
And in that garden, roses bloomed everywhere.

9
00:00:44,799 --> 00:00:48,619
One thousand, two thousand... five thousand roses!

10
00:00:48,919 --> 00:00:51,859
I thought my rose was the only one in the universe.

11
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:55,259
But she has five thousand sisters, all the same.

12
00:00:55,559 --> 00:00:58,819
The little prince sat on the grass, feeling sad.

13
00:00:59,119 --> 00:01:02,059
His rose had told him she was one of a kind.

14
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:05,939
But here, every rose said the same thing.

15
00:01:06,239 --> 00:01:08,459
My rose is just an ordinary flower.

16
00:01:08,759 --> 00:01:12,419
Oh, the little prince is so sad...

17
00:01:12,719 --> 00:01:15,099
Just then, a fox appeared.

18
00:01:15,399 --> 00:01:18,979
Look, those five thousand roses do look the same.

19
00:01:19,279 --> 00:01:24,459
But — your rose is the one you watered, protected, and cared for.

20
00:01:24,759 --> 00:01:27,139
You listened to her complaints and her pride.

21
00:01:27,439 --> 00:01:31,259
You put a glass cover over her at night, you worried about her.

22
00:01:31,559 --> 00:01:34,899
It's the time you spent with her that makes her so important.

23
00:01:35,199 --> 00:01:37,499
You truly see only with your heart.

24
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:39,539
The little prince looked up.

25
00:01:39,839 --> 00:01:42,699
Yes, my rose is more important than all of you together.

26
00:01:42,999 --> 00:01:44,899
Because she is MY rose.

27
00:01:45,199 --> 00:01:48,379
Kids, do you have something special?

28
00:01:48,679 --> 00:01:53,379
Maybe a toy, a drawing, or a person.

29
00:01:53,679 --> 00:01:59,499
It might look ordinary, but to you it's one of a kind.

30
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:09,299
What's your most special thing? Tell Qiqi in the comments~

31
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:18,459
Next time, the little prince meets a clever fox who will share an even bigger secret!

32
00:02:18,759 --> 00:02:21,859
Good night, see you tomorrow~ ⭐

